# The mayor's evening walk, run with @spec as mobile_update would, with the clock at 8 in the evening and only
# area_update running. The mayor (3143) starts asleep in his office (3138), where Smokegod (60) waits; Heroic (51,
# 30000 hit points) follows him.
# - he wakes; Heroic is attacked by him, and while he's fighting he casts as a mage (spec_cast_mage) instead of
#   walking
# - peace, and the 51 steps left of the close path: he walks, says his lines, closes the gates, comes home and
#   goes back to sleep
@clock 1763400360
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
goto 3138
holylight
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer heroic 3138
set char heroic hp 30000
restore heroic
@mob 3143 3138
@spec
force mayor kill heroic
@spec 8
peace
restore heroic
@as hero
follow mayor
@as god
@spec 51
@as hero
look
@state
